>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Balanced Difficulty Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hp\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">HP</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">55</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Resistances <sup><a href=\"/wiki/Resistances\" title=\"Resistances\">(info)</a></sup></h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"resistances\" data-item-name=\"resistances\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/42px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/56px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png/28px-Poison_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Poison_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Immune to all Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/42px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/56px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Immune to all Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png/28px-Psychic_Immunity.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Psychic_Immunity.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li></ul></div>\n</div></section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Conditions</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"conditions\" data-item-name=\"conditions\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Pearl_(Condition)\" title=\"Healing Pearl (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Healing Pearl\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Generic_Healing_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Pearl_(Condition)\" title=\"Healing Pearl (Condition)\"><b>Healing Pearl</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><ul><li>At the start of its turn, this mushroom keeping Auntie Ethel alive regains all its hit points unless some effect prevents it from restorative healing.</li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-content\" data-ref=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class